#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1004 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "ADAPTED-FROM fda/FDA-SD1004/FDA-SD1004-invalid-DM.cdt (data and pins verbatim). ARMCD on row 2 is 21 characters, one past the 20-character limit -> fires; the 20-character row 1 is the passing boundary."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 ARMCD=PLACEBO-RUN-IN-ARM-AB
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM     type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | PLACEBO-RUN-IN-ARM-A | Placebo run-in arm A
S1 | DM | 002 | PLACEBO-RUN-IN-ARM-AB | Placebo run-in arm AB
